he new lock path, it yielded False while keeping the legacy file descriptor\nheld until the context manager exited. Callers like activate_dependencies\nintentionally proceed unlocked inside the with-block when held is False, so\nthe legacy lock remained blocked for pre-upgrade processes.\n\nClose and clear held descriptors before yielding False on timeout, matching\nmoved_lock's documented contract.","tree":{"sha":"88e5371bbd2dfedf4a25f7c04616bbdf79707fee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/git/trees/88e5371bbd2dfedf4a25f7c04616bbdf79707fee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/git/commits/d86369b9d5781cf9ecc4fe3fc104b8b56e653616","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commits/d86369b9d5781cf9ecc4fe3fc104b8b56e653616","html_url":"https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commit/d86369b9d5781cf9ecc4fe3fc104b8b56e653616","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/commits/d86369b9d5781cf9ecc4fe3fc104b8b56e653616/comments","author":{"login":"BearHuddleston","id":196404565,"node_id":"U_kgDOC7TlVQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196404565?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BearHuddleston","html_url":"https://github.com/BearHuddleston","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BearHuddleston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BearHuddleston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BearHuddleston/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BearHuddleston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BearHuddleston/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BearHuddleston/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BearHuddleston/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bear